k the winner") (code-of "A refusal, verbatim") (note-of "About that example")) (sub "Only if you say what you based it on" (prose "Saying nothing about the base")) (one-card "Measured under real concurrency")) (sec "evaluate" "06" "A Lisp machine: a living knowledge base" (copy "F6 lead") (sub "Evaluation in the block" (prose "Evaluate intro")) (sub "Evaluate at a point in history" (prose "Evaluate at a point in history") (code-of "History evaluation, verbatim") (quasiquote (p (@ (class "lead") (style "margin-top:18px")) "The definition was changed between the two calls. The second asks for the " "earlier cut and gets the behaviour that was there then."))) (sub "What the sandbox is given" (prose "The sandbox, plainly")) (sub "Branches side by side: not yet" (prose "What evaluation does not do yet"))) (sec "measured" "Measured" "Numbers, and where they came from" #f (nums-panel "Numbers") (note-of "How the numbers were taken")) (sec "start" "Start" "A store is a directory" #f (code-of "Quickstart") (quasiquote (p (@ (class "lead") (style "margin-top:22px")) (unquote (copy "Install"))))))))))
